    "text": "By cfelixcpa ,\n8 hours ago April 29, 2026 — HCA Florida Westside Hospital celebrated the grand opening and ribbon-cutting of its new Neurointerventional Suite last week, marking a significant investment in advanced care for the community. The state-of-the-art suite enhances the hospital’s ability to deliver minimally invasive procedures and further strengthens its comprehensive neurology and cardiology services. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
